      "title": "CMake: Allow overriding rpath on macOS",
      "message": "CMake: Allow overriding rpath on macOS\n\nDon't ignore CMAKE_INSTALL_RPATH on macOS. This allows you to install\nand run in a custom path e.g.:\n\n        cmake -H. -Bbuild -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=./inst -DCMAKE_INSTALL_RPATH=\"$PWD/inst/lib\"\n\nBy default CMAKE_INSTALL_RPATH is empty, so this change shouldn't have\nan effect if CMAKE_INSTALL_RPATH isn't explicitly set.\n",
